##### crates/cloud_api_types/src

Shared cloud API types (user, plan info, subscription periods, LLM tokens) and WebSocket message protocol.

**Files:**

- `crates/cloud_api_types/src/cloud_api_types.rs` (rel=4): Defines cloud API types for authenticated user responses, plan info (bridging PlanV1/V2), subscription periods, and LLM tokens, exposing feature flags and usage data. PlanInfo::plan unifies plan handling across versions for consumers.

#### crates/cloud_llm_client

LLM client library used across provider integrations and cloud features.

