- `crates/copilot/src/copilot_completion_provider.rs` (rel=4): Implements an EditPredictionProvider for Copilot that fetches, cycles, and accepts inline AI completions with debounce, deduping, and buffer tracking. Computes insertion edits by trimming common prefix/suffix against the buffer, supports cycling-triggered refresh, and coordinates with Copilot entity tasks.
