- `crates/diagnostics/src/diagnostics.rs` (rel=5): Wires the diagnostics feature by initializing the renderer, registering editors, and defining actions (Deploy/ToggleWarnings/ToggleDiagnosticsRefresh). Implements ProjectDiagnosticsEditor to aggregate project diagnostics into a multibuffer editor, manage per-buffer blocks, debounce updates from project events, and react to focus/save to rebuild excerpts.
- `crates/diagnostics/src/buffer_diagnostics.rs` (rel=4): Implements BufferDiagnosticsEditor for a single file, rendering diagnostics excerpts in a multibuffer-backed editor with custom blocks and severity filtering. Subscribes to project and editor events to update excerpts on changes/focus, and provides an action to deploy for the current file with global warning inclusion support.
- `crates/diagnostics/src/diagnostic_renderer.rs` (rel=4): Builds Markdown diagnostic blocks for groups and renders them as editor custom blocks or hover popovers, including cross-links between related diagnostics and metadata (source/code). Implements the editor::DiagnosticRenderer interface and handles link clicks to navigate within diagnostics or open external URLs.
- `crates/diagnostics/src/items.rs` (rel=4): Implements a status bar DiagnosticIndicator that displays error/warning counts and the nearest diagnostic message with a click action to jump to the next one or open the diagnostics panel. Subscribes to project/editor events and debounces updates to keep the summary and context-sensitive status in sync.

