- `crates/extension/src/extension_builder.rs` (rel=4): Builds Rust WASM extensions and tree-sitter grammars: installs targets/WASI SDK, runs cargo build, strips custom sections, extracts and writes zed:api-version, and compiles grammars via clang. Validates debug adapter schemas and writes extension.wasm.
- `crates/extension/src/extension_host_proxy.rs` (rel=4): Central proxy registry that aggregates theme, grammar, language, language server, snippets, slash command, context server, and debug adapter proxies. Provides registration and forwarding methods to decouple extension host consumers from concrete implementations.
