- `crates/extension_api/wit/since_v0.0.6/github.wit` (rel=4): Defines a WIT interface for retrieving the latest GitHub release with version and asset metadata, including options to filter pre-releases and require assets. Serves as part of the extension API for external release discovery.
- `crates/extension_api/wit/since_v0.0.6/lsp.wit` (rel=4): WIT definitions for LSP types used by extensions, including completion and symbol kinds and insert text formats with vendor extensions for constructors/interfaces/enums. Provides standardized data structures for UI labeling helpers.
- `crates/extension_api/wit/since_v0.0.6/nodejs.wit` (rel=4): Specifies Node.js-related APIs in WIT for locating Zed’s Node binary and interacting with NPM (latest version lookup, installed version, install). Enables extensions to manage Node/NPM dependencies consistently.

