- `crates/html_to_markdown/src/markdown_writer.rs` (rel=4): Traverses the HTML DOM, maintains an element stack, and orchestrates TagHandlers to build a Markdown string while normalizing whitespace and newlines. Provides StartTagOutcome flow control, text handling hooks, and helpers to append markdown content.

