- `crates/markdown_preview/src/markdown_elements.rs` (rel=5): Defines the parsed Markdown AST (headings, lists, tables, block quotes, code blocks, paragraphs, images) and styling helpers including link/image identification and highlight-to-style conversion. Serves as the core data model for the Markdown renderer.
- `crates/markdown_preview/src/markdown_renderer.rs` (rel=5): Renders ParsedMarkdown into GPUI elements via a theme-aware RenderContext, handling headings, lists (including interactive task checkboxes), tables, block quotes, code blocks, rules, and images. Manages element IDs, scaled sizing, and supports checkbox click callbacks and link styling.
- `crates/markdown_preview/src/markdown_parser.rs` (rel=4): Parses Markdown into a structured ParsedMarkdown representation using pulldown_cmark with offset tracking, asynchronously handling blocks like headings, tables, lists, block quotes, code blocks (with language detection), and HTML blocks. It normalizes/minifies HTML, processes inline formatting (bold/italic/strikethrough), handles soft/hard breaks, and auto-detects links within text. Optional LanguageRegistry integration allows language-aware code block handling.
- `crates/markdown_preview/src/markdown_preview.rs` (rel=4): Defines actions for markdown preview navigation/opening and registers the MarkdownPreviewView on Workspace initialization. Implements the markdown preview feature with UI integration.
- `crates/markdown_preview/src/markdown_preview_view.rs` (rel=4): Implements a workspace-integrated Markdown preview view with Default and Follow modes, registering actions to open previews in panes and reusing existing views per editor. Observes workspace focus to follow the active markdown editor and manages parsing/rendering lifecycle.

