- `crates/project/src/debugger/locators/go.rs` (rel=4): Generates Delve launch configurations for `go test` and `go run` tasks by parsing and classifying Go flags, handling special escaping cases, and assembling program, args, build flags, and environment. Produces DebugScenario objects for the Delve adapter and leaves run() unreachable as the adapter handles execution.

