- `crates/remote/src/transport/ssh.rs` (rel=5): Implements an SSH-based RemoteConnection, establishing a master connection (ControlMaster) and using the control socket for commands, uploads (scp), and proxy startup. Builds remote commands with env propagation, manages process lifecycle, and bridges RPC via the stdio transport.
- `crates/remote/src/transport/wsl.rs` (rel=5): Implements WSL-based RemoteConnection, detecting shell/exec capability/architecture, ensuring the remote server binary is present (download or build), uploading and extracting it in WSL, then running commands. Converts Windows paths to WSL, and orchestrates installation and environment probing with robust error handling.

