- `crates/remote_server/src/unix.rs` (rel=5): Implements the Unix-side server runtime with structured logging, crash file retrieval, and three-socket (stdin/stdout/stderr) listeners. Manages an idle timeout, message read/write over size-prefixed envelopes, and app lifecycle coordination via async tasks.
