- `crates/settings/src/settings_store.rs` (rel=5): Global settings store that registers setting types, merges default/user/server/local values, and exposes retrieval/override across locations with a background task for file updates. Manages editorconfig parsing, per-worktree settings, recomputation on profile changes, and type-indexed storage via AnySettingValue.
