Utilities (contrast algorithms, corner radius, formatting helpers, search input, rem sizing) used across UI.

**Files:**

- `crates/ui/src/utils/apca_contrast.rs` (rel=4): Implements the APCA contrast algorithm and utilities to adjust foreground colors to meet a minimum perceptual contrast by tuning lightness and saturation, with fallback to black/white. Includes sRGB-to-luminance conversion and tests to validate contrast behavior.

