- `crates/ui_macros/src/dynamic_spacing.rs` (rel=4): Proc-macro generates a DynamicSpacing enum whose variants compute spacing in rem/px based on UI density, either from a single base value or explicit (compact, default, comfortable) tuples. It emits methods for rems/px and auto-docs variant sizes.

