- `crates/worktree/src/ignore.rs` (rel=4): Implements a layered Gitignore stack for path filtering, supporting global and per-directory rules with optional repo root remapping. The matching algorithm recurses through parent entries, short-circuits .git directories, and uses the ignore crate to determine ignore/whitelist behavior.

